{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/c8a4ac1263a61cf6f7e58009bba39a10.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><strong>BattleSynth \u2014 A Tactical Fantasy Battle Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>BattleSynth</strong>, every fight is a test of your strategy. You don\u2019t just play \u2014 you <i>command</i> an army of knights, wizards, assassins, beasts, and strange fantasy creatures, and watch them clash in chaotic, beautiful auto-battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your formation, predict enemy moves, and build the perfect mix of strength, range, and magic. Victory doesn\u2019t always belong to the strongest \u2014 sometimes it\u2019s the cleverest who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Auto-Battles.</strong> Deploy your units wisely and let your formation decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/6072b047a89d4c87599bfd35541163a0.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Heroes.</strong> Every unit type brings its own role \u2014 from long-range mages to fearless knights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemies.</strong> No two battles feel the same \u2014 adapt or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/9144e31eb69b8c5194c0be5169526b77.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Abilities.</strong> Throw spears, heal allies, or unleash devastating spells at the perfect moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Fantasy Style.</strong> A hand-drawn world where every clash feels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/extras/b02979f32d5c6fa88d33c441103c2909.avif?t=1773805129\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>BattleSynth</strong> is like fantasy chess \u2014 easy to start, hard to master. Combine, experiment, and lead your army to victory in a world where every move counts.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"CoolMan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097240/c2c084ac1dc029c3e01211799b4d2390113c3e86.jpg"},{"name":"Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097240/06738f911485bb5bb1ccd51d482aee9aa90cb8bf.jpg"},{"name":"Monstr ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097240/06f2320ae2e44b9ce81c01d32c20e9f5a717ad77.jpg"},{"name":"God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097240/8e175fdf2f4ce3c022caded91ce8e5b63b3949a0.jpg"},{"name":"End 40 lvl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097240/2c20a0465b13e2af0bcc86956a2563468c021c61.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097240?t=1773805129","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097240?t=1773805129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/843eb886c83ad09a03267c337befc542652ad806/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773805129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097240/843eb886c83ad09a03267c337befc542652ad806/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773805129","cate